WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:05.230
Dear Mother, Francis is coming to Vienna with me.

00:05.990 --> 00:09.520
He will testify that I am your true daughter.

00:10.410 --> 00:13.300
Though for some reason, his childhood friend Mary Ann has also joined us.

00:14.260 --> 00:16.910
But right now, I want to see you as soon as possible.

00:26.730 --> 00:27.890
NAAJA

00:26.730 --> 00:27.890
Nadja

00:27.920 --> 00:30.390
kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:27.940 --> 00:30.390
With your eyes

00:30.390 --> 00:31.550
NAAJA

00:30.440 --> 00:31.550
Nadja

00:31.570 --> 00:33.820
nani ga mieru

00:31.570 --> 00:33.820
What do you see?

00:34.040 --> 00:36.930
haruka tooku hikaru

00:34.040 --> 00:36.930
Shining in the far distance,

00:37.080 --> 00:39.220
mirai no tobira

00:37.080 --> 00:39.220
The door to the future,

00:40.360 --> 00:43.770
sagashiteiru

00:40.360 --> 00:43.770
That's what I'm searching for

00:43.770 --> 00:50.980
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.690 --> 00:55.100
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:55.200 --> 00:58.460
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

00:55.200 --> 00:58.460
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:58.530 --> 01:01.910
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

00:58.560 --> 01:01.910
It could be so much more fun

01:01.940 --> 01:05.390
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:01.940 --> 01:05.390
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:05.760 --> 01:09.120
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:05.760 --> 01:09.120
I can't see the end of the journey

01:09.150 --> 01:12.310
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:09.150 --> 01:12.310
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:12.480 --> 01:16.130
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:12.480 --> 01:16.130
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:16.130 --> 01:18.280
te wo furinagara

01:16.130 --> 01:18.280
I will go waving

01:18.430 --> 01:25.170
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:18.430 --> 01:25.170
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:25.170 --> 01:27.910
ushiro mukanai

01:25.170 --> 01:27.910
But I won't look back

01:28.180 --> 01:33.220
yume ga kanau hima de

01:28.180 --> 01:33.220
Until the day my dream comes true

01:33.390 --> 01:36.770
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

01:33.390 --> 01:36.770
Nadja, your smile

01:36.850 --> 01:40.050
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:36.850 --> 01:40.050
Nadja, you give me courage

01:40.350 --> 01:43.310
aoi sora no shita de

01:40.350 --> 01:43.310
Under the blue sky

01:43.290 --> 01:46.100
ashita no yukue

01:43.290 --> 01:46.100
I will find the place

01:46.620 --> 01:50.250
mitsu kerukara

01:46.620 --> 01:50.250
Where my future lies

02:05.940 --> 02:07.250
Thank you, Francis.

02:07.820 --> 02:08.980
Don't mention it.

02:10.140 --> 02:11.700
May I also have the favor?

02:13.370 --> 02:13.890
Please.

02:18.040 --> 02:19.990
I'm almost there.

02:20.140 --> 02:21.720
In Vienna where Mother is!

02:25.420 --> 02:26.460
Rosemary...

02:27.840 --> 02:29.450
Who has seen the wind?

02:30.410 --> 02:32.060
No one has seen the wind.

02:33.100 --> 02:37.200
But when these flowers bloom, the wind passes through them.

02:39.470 --> 02:39.990
Nadja.

02:40.950 --> 02:42.090
It's almost time.

02:42.900 --> 02:44.920
I understand. Well then, Mother.

02:46.060 --> 02:46.920
Nadja...

02:48.480 --> 02:49.790
The place of a princess...

02:50.310 --> 02:51.290
Mother is...

02:51.890 --> 02:53.290
I won't had her over to you!

02:51.890 --> 02:53.290
I won't had it over to you!

02:59.550 --> 03:03.860
Confrontation of the Two Nadjas

03:07.290 --> 03:11.010
Ah, this time...this time I can meet Mother, right?

03:23.140 --> 03:26.150
She will surely understand that I am her true daughter.

03:27.130 --> 03:29.380
She will understand that I am Nadja...

03:30.790 --> 03:34.740
I have already met Duke Preminger previously.

03:35.380 --> 03:37.330
I am sure he will listen to what you have to say.

03:37.950 --> 03:39.060
Yes, thank you.

03:39.430 --> 03:40.120
It will be okay.

03:40.490 --> 03:41.630
I am with you.

03:47.600 --> 03:49.850
We have to do something to get through this.

03:50.390 --> 03:52.690
You absolutely can't be caught on the wrong end.

03:53.530 --> 03:54.640
What an unsightly person.

03:55.670 --> 03:59.600
With you behaving like that, it will surely be impossible.

03:59.670 --> 04:00.540
S-sorry.

04:01.300 --> 04:04.960
Even if you show up now, you have no way to win, Nadja.

04:05.470 --> 04:11.180
Because more than anyone, I am a princess suitable to become the successor of the House of Preminger.

04:27.990 --> 04:29.890
Finally, I get to meet Mother.

04:30.240 --> 04:32.700
Now come, I will take the lead.

04:34.900 --> 04:35.960
Let's go, Nadja.

04:37.250 --> 04:37.960
Francis...

04:41.050 --> 04:45.590
You are Francis Harcourt, son of Duke Harcourt, correct?

04:45.960 --> 04:46.530
Yes.

04:48.160 --> 04:51.420
We have brought the Duke's granddaughter, Nadja, with us.

04:51.890 --> 04:54.330
If it is alright with you, I will go contact the Duke.

04:54.850 --> 04:55.490
Please come in.

04:55.890 --> 04:56.580
Thank you.

05:05.290 --> 05:06.250
Wow!

05:07.340 --> 05:09.610
Mother lives in this house, doesn't she?

05:10.110 --> 05:12.920
I wonder if she walks along this long corridor?

05:14.650 --> 05:15.730
Is this the room?

05:16.430 --> 05:16.870
Yes.

05:17.310 --> 05:19.390
Mother is there... Mother!

05:19.960 --> 05:21.070
Mother!

05:26.670 --> 05:28.150
Um, where is mother...?

05:28.470 --> 05:30.570
As usual, you have bad manners.

05:31.360 --> 05:33.660
Entering a room without even knocking.

05:34.650 --> 05:36.470
Rosemary! Herman!

05:37.110 --> 05:38.050
Rosemary?

05:39.340 --> 05:41.090
Isn't that your name?

05:41.930 --> 05:43.060
I am Nadja.

05:44.030 --> 05:45.480
Nadja, control yourself.

05:46.570 --> 05:49.190
I wonder if you knew, grandfather.

05:54.150 --> 05:55.160
This person is...

05:56.250 --> 05:57.160
My grandfather?

05:59.380 --> 06:01.330
I am pleased to meet you, Duke Preminger.

06:01.930 --> 06:04.490
I am Francis Harcourt.

06:04.910 --> 06:07.060
This is my childhood friend, Mary Ann.

06:08.220 --> 06:11.430
We have brought your granddaughter Nadja with us.

06:13.530 --> 06:14.390
It's him!

06:19.500 --> 06:21.720
He is...the Black Rose!

06:23.450 --> 06:27.800
He is Francis of the House of Harcourt!?

06:29.030 --> 06:32.640
So it's you? You say you are my real granddaughter?

06:33.010 --> 06:34.830
Yes. I am Nadja.

06:35.820 --> 06:40.860
It doesn't matter how much you wear my brooch. You can't become me, Rosemary.

06:41.230 --> 06:42.040
Rosemary...

06:42.390 --> 06:44.490
This brooch was mine to begin with.

06:44.930 --> 06:47.080
Throughout the time when I was being raised at Applefield.

06:47.500 --> 06:48.810
You would know, wouldn't you?

06:49.420 --> 06:49.920
Nadja!

06:51.050 --> 06:54.830
Actually, a reporter from Montmartre came by.

06:55.600 --> 06:58.710
It seems this man also thought you were the real Nadja.

06:58.810 --> 07:00.560
Harvey! It was Harvey, wasn't it?

07:00.900 --> 07:02.780
Ah, he went through the trouble of coming...

07:03.130 --> 07:06.900
But, this is something a mere newspaper reporter is saying.

07:09.030 --> 07:11.910
The only one I trust is myself.

07:12.900 --> 07:17.540
I will ascertain who the real Nadja is.

07:21.620 --> 07:24.730
Well firstly, hand over that brooch.

07:25.670 --> 07:26.230
No...

07:26.550 --> 07:27.290
I can't!

07:27.640 --> 07:30.650
This is a precious brooch that connects me to my mother!

07:31.170 --> 07:32.970
I can't hand it over to anyone!

07:34.010 --> 07:37.490
You have the audacity to say such things even though you stole it from me.

07:38.330 --> 07:40.820
You're wrong. Don't lie, Rosemary!

07:41.140 --> 07:43.220
The one who is lying is you, isn't it?

07:43.590 --> 07:44.160
Why...

07:44.800 --> 07:46.450
Why are you such a cruel...!

07:47.120 --> 07:47.880
Stop this.

07:50.300 --> 07:54.500
From the beginning, I was the one who had this brooch made for Colette.

07:54.970 --> 07:57.960
The one who I decide to be the real Nadja will wear it.

07:58.700 --> 07:59.220
Nadja...

08:00.430 --> 08:02.990
You have no reason to feel guilty.

08:03.410 --> 08:05.070
It would be better to work through this properly.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.510
Indeed, this is the real thing.

08:19.900 --> 08:21.260
The red ring, too.

08:22.940 --> 08:24.540
What cold eyes he is making.

08:25.660 --> 08:27.330
This person is my grandfather...?

08:29.090 --> 08:29.610
However...

08:30.450 --> 08:32.000
This is something that has been stolen.

08:32.400 --> 08:37.800
Just because you are wearing this brooch isn't proof that you are the real Nadja.

08:38.250 --> 08:40.810
But it has been mine since long ago!

08:42.420 --> 08:43.230
Grandfather.

08:43.680 --> 08:48.420
Please quickly see who is the real Nadja with your own eyes.

08:49.260 --> 08:49.870
Yes.

08:50.570 --> 08:51.870
It will be as you say.

08:53.030 --> 08:53.950
Let's begin.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.290
Firstly...

08:58.930 --> 09:03.450
If you insist upon being called my real granddaughter, tell me your reasons for doing so.

09:08.980 --> 09:09.620
Mother...

09:13.450 --> 09:14.730
Until I meet you...

09:15.500 --> 09:17.280
I definitely won't lose!

09:20.120 --> 09:25.150
This is something I received shortly before my thirteenth birthday.

09:27.940 --> 09:30.460
This is my Mother's ball diary.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.880
She had something like that?

09:36.160 --> 09:36.730
Also...

09:38.610 --> 09:39.690
Mother's dress.

09:40.380 --> 09:44.240
It was damaged by Rosemary, but I was able to repair it to this.

09:46.660 --> 09:47.640
Give that to me.

09:48.140 --> 09:48.800
How cruel!

09:49.820 --> 09:52.530
To render my mother's dress to such a state...!

09:55.120 --> 09:56.010
Rosemary...?

09:57.320 --> 10:00.950
Grandfather, this was originally something that I received.

10:01.490 --> 10:08.280
But on the night that the orphanage burned down, this girl stole my brooch and trunk and ran away!

10:08.380 --> 10:09.340
What are you saying!?

10:09.390 --> 10:11.690
Nadja would never do such a thing!

10:11.890 --> 10:15.340
Besides, she has worn the brooch right from the beginning!

10:16.230 --> 10:20.010
Did you meet her for the first time before the fire?

10:21.660 --> 10:22.060
No.

10:22.500 --> 10:27.810
But she was very happy to know that her mother, whom she thought dead, might be alive.

10:28.130 --> 10:32.430
And she was searching for her mother using the brooch and diary as clues.

10:32.570 --> 10:34.060
She's been trying her best up until now.

10:34.250 --> 10:34.700
Hmph.

10:35.120 --> 10:37.310
You can say anything with your mouth.

10:37.960 --> 10:41.680
Then, I will sing a song that I have known since childhood.

10:45.190 --> 10:50.350
Above a quiet forest...

10:50.720 --> 10:55.850
A single shining star,

10:56.350 --> 11:01.260
sings a song of love...

10:58.940 --> 11:02.130
I see. She was always there when I sang this.

11:02.840 --> 11:04.470
Of course Rosemary remembers it.

11:06.870 --> 11:07.630
Stop this!

11:10.720 --> 11:14.720
But this is a song that my father composed for me!

11:15.160 --> 11:18.490
What sort of proof is that?

11:20.170 --> 11:21.310
Oh no.

11:21.800 --> 11:26.470
Because of that song, I am remembering my life at the orphanage even though I was finally able to forget it.

11:27.330 --> 11:30.440
There is no way you could forget, Rosemary!

11:36.960 --> 11:39.870
We always lived together, getting along well.

11:40.740 --> 11:43.620
Protected by the chairwoman and Miss Evans.

11:44.370 --> 11:45.750
Almost like a family.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.030
That is...

11:49.700 --> 11:51.550
...your sad imagination.

11:51.870 --> 11:59.050
In reality we had to work everyday, were teased, and received terrible reproaches from the chairwoman.

11:59.350 --> 12:00.170
Stop it!

12:00.340 --> 12:02.290
Don't talk about the chairwoman like that!

12:02.730 --> 12:03.840
The chairwoman...

12:04.310 --> 12:06.490
The chairwoman has died!

12:06.910 --> 12:07.450
What?

12:09.350 --> 12:11.180
The chairwoman has...?

12:12.930 --> 12:16.980
No matter how cruel a person she was, for her to die...

12:18.110 --> 12:19.250
Rosemary...!

12:19.470 --> 12:22.580
You...you...how....how cruel!

12:23.960 --> 12:24.560
Nadja!

12:25.030 --> 12:26.560
You can't let yourself be distracted!

12:36.180 --> 12:37.540
That's right, Rosemary.

12:37.760 --> 12:38.970
That's the way.

12:39.320 --> 12:45.990
Now then, I will go and fetch the right people appropriate for this stage.

12:50.950 --> 12:53.220
There is no way you can win against me.

12:53.890 --> 12:55.860
Stupid, little Nadja.

13:17.360 --> 13:19.290
Waltmüller House

13:20.270 --> 13:20.820
Colette.

13:22.520 --> 13:23.160
Dear...

13:25.380 --> 13:28.050
Today Nadja called for me.

13:28.300 --> 13:29.010
Is that so.

13:29.680 --> 13:34.050
Even so, I wonder when your father will allow her to be taken out of there.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.830
I do not know.

13:36.840 --> 13:40.790
Even though we are father and daughter, I don't understand his thinking at all.

13:56.860 --> 14:01.970
The night when the orphanage burned down, Rosemary stole my brooch and trunk.

14:02.190 --> 14:04.240
I felt in danger.

14:05.160 --> 14:12.660
This girl has always loved to entertain and sometimes couldn't distinguish between what was reality.

14:13.550 --> 14:14.880
Isn't that you?

14:15.670 --> 14:18.760
That's why I got scared and ran away.

14:19.050 --> 14:22.310
To somewhere I wouldn't be found by her...in Spain.

14:26.910 --> 14:30.020
Now that I think about it, perhaps the fire was also caused by her...

14:30.190 --> 14:31.230
What did you say?

14:31.970 --> 14:32.630
That's right.

14:32.930 --> 14:36.580
No matter how bad a girl you are, even you wouldn't go that far.

14:36.900 --> 14:37.640
I'm sorry.

14:38.560 --> 14:39.640
I have to say something.

14:39.870 --> 14:43.770
If I don't, they will all take what Rosemary says as the truth.

14:44.430 --> 14:45.840
I won't be able to meet Mother anymore.

14:48.110 --> 14:50.950
But I'm not angry, Rosemary.

14:51.070 --> 14:53.810
I am very happy now, after all.

14:54.430 --> 14:55.390
Don't touch me!

14:58.230 --> 14:59.100
Nadja!

15:00.880 --> 15:02.680
What a rude girl she is!

15:02.850 --> 15:04.680
I'm fine, Uncle Herman.

15:15.980 --> 15:16.530
What is it?

15:17.090 --> 15:18.630
It's Rosso and Bianco.

15:18.920 --> 15:22.010
Nobody knew anything about them and I couldn't contact them.

15:23.270 --> 15:25.810
At this crucial time, they take flight.

15:26.480 --> 15:27.610
Rosso and Bianco...

15:29.510 --> 15:30.150
That's right!

15:31.020 --> 15:32.010
It's them.

15:32.450 --> 15:37.910
They followed me all the way to Egypt and stole my brooch there.

15:39.880 --> 15:41.020
By this man's order.

15:42.450 --> 15:45.880
I learned about Rosso and Bianco from the newspaper reporter.

15:46.700 --> 15:49.660
But I hired those two detectives.

15:51.140 --> 15:54.670
That's why I didn't trust the newspaper reporter.

15:55.460 --> 15:58.350
But if you had something to do with it, then that's different.

16:01.530 --> 16:02.940
That's not true, grandfather!

16:03.730 --> 16:10.220
Those two went to Egypt by his order to take back my brooch.

16:12.570 --> 16:17.510
Mr. Rosso and Mr. Bianco were searching for me by the request of Uncle Herman.

16:17.920 --> 16:18.810
What did you say?

16:20.000 --> 16:22.250
T-that's right, father.

16:22.690 --> 16:27.970
Up until now I have done a lot of things unbefitting the Dukedom and have caused a lot of trouble.

16:28.150 --> 16:34.100
That's why I thought I could help by finding Nadja, which is why I hired those two.

16:34.470 --> 16:37.450
But you hired them as well...

16:37.850 --> 16:42.190
Those detectives have received payments from both of us, haven't they?

16:45.010 --> 16:47.770
Do you have anything to object to?

16:50.090 --> 16:54.340
Then, why not ask people from the orphanage who know her from back then.

16:54.930 --> 16:55.450
That's right.

16:55.800 --> 17:01.080
Miss Evans, Oliver, Rex, and the others will testify who the real Nadja is.

17:02.540 --> 17:06.290
So you can procure testimony from these people?

17:07.280 --> 17:07.740
Yes.

17:11.500 --> 17:12.190
Grandfather...

17:13.370 --> 17:17.670
If you continue to cling to that doubt, then I also want to bring everybody.

17:19.220 --> 17:22.210
But is that really necessary?

17:24.630 --> 17:26.280
I am Nadja Preminger.

17:26.850 --> 17:29.810
There is nothing that can change that.

17:30.230 --> 17:36.900
Because everyone will recognize that I, more than anyone, am a person befitting the House of Preminger.

17:43.100 --> 17:43.790
Then...

17:44.280 --> 17:49.320
The fact that I am my mother's daughter and my mother is my mother will not change.

17:49.890 --> 17:53.070
Even if Grandfather decides that you are Nadja.

17:55.710 --> 17:57.240
Please wait. You are causing trouble!

18:00.820 --> 18:01.690
You people...

18:02.010 --> 18:03.460
W-wait. Wait, please.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.650
We are the police.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.520
I-it's that man!

18:15.630 --> 18:17.070
The Black Rose!

18:19.240 --> 18:20.330
I saw it!

18:20.700 --> 18:24.840
I saw him when he broke into the mansion and stole the brooch.

18:28.370 --> 18:29.140
Francis!

18:29.510 --> 18:30.050
No!

18:31.020 --> 18:32.690
Francis is not the Black Rose!

18:32.870 --> 18:34.130
The real Black Rose is...

18:35.630 --> 18:37.930
The real Black Rose is who...?

18:39.380 --> 18:40.000
I can't.

18:40.350 --> 18:42.490
I can't say that Keith is the real Black Rose.

18:43.240 --> 18:45.310
But like this, Francis will...

18:47.380 --> 18:48.370
Say it!

18:48.470 --> 18:50.150
Who is the real Black Rose?

18:51.600 --> 18:52.890
Say it, young lady!

19:00.890 --> 19:01.500
It's me.

19:07.430 --> 19:09.110
I am the Black Rose.

19:12.860 --> 19:13.630
Francis!

19:14.440 --> 19:15.920
What are you doing?

19:17.770 --> 19:18.440
No!

19:19.210 --> 19:20.190
You're wrong!

19:20.640 --> 19:21.110
Nadja!

19:21.800 --> 19:22.590
Francis isn't...

19:22.860 --> 19:24.320
He absolutely isn't!

19:24.780 --> 19:25.940
Francis!

19:28.340 --> 19:29.130
Francis!

19:31.100 --> 19:31.990
Francis...

19:32.560 --> 19:33.300
Why...

19:35.130 --> 19:36.660
You will also come with us.

19:36.880 --> 19:37.470
What?

19:38.120 --> 19:41.300
As someone connected to the Black Rose, we have quite a few questions for you.

19:42.260 --> 19:43.570
We have caused a mess.

19:44.860 --> 19:45.370
No!

19:45.650 --> 19:46.880
I want to see Mother!

19:47.150 --> 19:48.410
Show me my Mother!

19:48.560 --> 19:49.500
Please!

19:50.020 --> 19:51.500
Mother!

20:03.620 --> 20:05.100
Just what was that about.

20:05.740 --> 20:10.090
Well well, for the son of the Harcourt Dukedom to be the Black Rose...

20:10.360 --> 20:14.850
When he entered the room, I was really taken aback.

20:16.550 --> 20:21.790
But with this, we have obtained the conclusion to who the real Nadja is.

20:22.260 --> 20:29.640
That girl joined with the Black Rose and tried to enter the House of Preminger to steal its wealth and assets.

20:29.710 --> 20:31.740
Be silent, Uncle Herman!

20:33.340 --> 20:37.020
When you open your mouth, there is only talk of wealth and assets.

20:38.800 --> 20:41.910
You don't have a shred of pride or responsibility as a noble.

20:42.430 --> 20:46.800
It's natural that grandfather wouldn't want to leave the Dukedom to you.

20:47.240 --> 20:48.620
Y-you...

20:48.920 --> 20:50.280
What are you saying?

20:50.750 --> 20:58.720
Herman, if you don't realize what a greedy person you are, you will end up a dull man.

20:59.680 --> 21:01.390
Wear this.

21:02.420 --> 21:03.460
Grandfather!

21:04.050 --> 21:06.550
You understood after all, didn't you?

21:10.050 --> 21:13.900
But please somehow help Rosemary.

21:14.170 --> 21:17.380
No matter how bad a girl she is, she is still an old playmate.

21:19.750 --> 21:21.140
I'll think about it.

21:40.590 --> 21:41.580
Francis!

21:41.970 --> 21:43.110
Francis!

21:43.780 --> 21:44.960
Francis...!

21:51.430 --> 21:52.340
Mother...

21:53.180 --> 21:54.020
